<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Both are warranted: The dance style is beauti=
ful, but it can be painful and physically demanding, in large part thanks t=
o pointe shoes.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">What=E2=80=99s the=
 pointe?</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">With its flattened end designed to let the we=
arer stand on tiptoe, the pointe shoe is an ingrained part of ballet. It=E2=
=80=99s also an expensive one.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And while most of us would just need one pair=
 of dancin=E2=80=99 shoes (or none =E2=80=94 no one should have to witness =
that), ballerinas burn through their slippers at record pace.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">One ballerina <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotl=
